 p:[["Ola","Product Manager"],["Journalist","Tech magazine"]],
 d:[[0,"I'm delighted to introduce FitTrack Go. It's been designed with everyday gym users in mind."],[1,"How is it different from the big brands?"],[0,"I'm glad you asked that. What sets it apart is that there's no subscription — you pay once, and that's it."],[1,"But the screen is smaller than the competition's."],[0,"That's a fair question. You're right that the screen is smaller. However, that's why the battery lasts ten days."],[1,"Early reviews mention problems with the app."],[0,"Thank you for raising that. A number of users have pointed out that syncing is slow. We've taken those comments on board."],[1,"So what are you doing about it?"],[0,"We're already working on an update that fixes syncing. It'll be ready in two weeks."],[1,"And overall?"],[0,"Overall, early feedback has been very positive — 4.5 stars from over 2,000 users. Let me show you how it works."]],
 q:[["What sets FitTrack Go apart?","The big screen","No subscription","The colour","The price is the highest",1],["Why is the small screen good, according to Ola?","It's cheaper.","The battery lasts ten days.","It looks better.","It's lighter.",1],["What problem do users mention?","Slow syncing","Broken straps","High price","Bad battery",0],["How does Ola handle the tough question?","She admits the weakness and bridges to a strength.","She says it's not true.","She refuses to answer.","She changes the subject.",0]],
 f:[["That's a stupid question.","That's a fair question.",["fair question","glad you asked"]],["The screen is not small!","You're right that the screen is smaller. However, the battery lasts ten days.",["you're right that","however"]],["We read the comments.","We've taken your comments on board.",["taken your comments on board","on board"]],["We fix it later maybe.","We're already working on an update that fixes it.",["already working on an update"]]],
